<section class="commit-band" aria-labelledby="cm-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--band-ink-2)">Our commitments</p>
      <h2 id="cm-title">Public-interest infrastructure, not a platform with an agenda</h2>
      <p>Rostrum is proposed as a not-for-profit service from the Modal Foundation, running on Eurosky's European infrastructure.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="commitments">
      <div class="commitment"><strong>Free for every MEP</strong><span>No fees, no premium tier for influence, no procurement needed.</span></div>
      <div class="commitment"><strong>Strictly cross-party</strong><span>The same service for every political group, governed independently of any party or institution.</span></div>
      <div class="commitment"><strong>No ads. No data sales.</strong><span>Your audience is never the product.</span></div>
      <div class="commitment"><strong>European jurisdiction</strong><span>Hosted in Germany, run by a Dutch non-profit, under the GDPR and the Digital Services Act.</span></div>
      <div class="commitment"><strong>Open protocol</strong><span>Built on the AT Protocol, so anyone can verify how it works and leave at any time.</span></div>
      <div class="commitment"><strong>Elected officials only</strong><span>MEPs first, then national, regional and local representatives.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
